      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "JER",
          "chapter": 46,
          "verse": 3
        }
      ],
      "en": "“Prepare the buckler and shield, and draw near to battle!",
      "ko": "너희는 큰 방패, 작은 방패를 예비하고 나가서 싸우라",
      "source_text_hash": "4a21e6293cabcf1a02c4a414d3738d40780f6ebb4a91b2e27ab6161480a464d7",
      "translation_text_hash": "a03f6c60024de2e15ae4e1868b9a278b948b1aa97ded8dcdbf26a907710767d5",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "너희는 큰 방패, 작은 방패를 예비하고 나가서 싸우라"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "a03f6c60024de2e15ae4e1868b9a278b948b1aa97ded8dcdbf26a907710767d5"
      ]
    },
    {
      "canonical_locator": "bible:web:JER:46:4",
      "sequence": 20050,
      "chapter_label": "JER 46",
