      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "JER",
          "chapter": 46,
          "verse": 4
        }
      ],
      "en": "Harness the horses, and get up, you horsemen, and stand up with your helmets. Polish the spears, put on the coats of mail.",
      "ko": "너희 기병이여 말에 안장을 지워 타며 투구를 쓰고 나서며 창을 갈며 갑옷을 입으라",
      "source_text_hash": "b83c975b06556509750034f69a110dd5f30a06025f2297f9f766f3a4536e456a",
      "translation_text_hash": "ff888c599607bf20a5c4a9d2a53f6438f3da7394ddb5c9880042a8bef5314901",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "너희 기병이여 말에 안장을 지워 타며 투구를 쓰고 나서며 창을 갈며 갑옷을 입으라"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "ff888c599607bf20a5c4a9d2a53f6438f3da7394ddb5c9880042a8bef5314901"
      ]
