      },
      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "JER",
          "chapter": 46,
          "verse": 15
        }
      ],
      "en": "Why are your strong ones swept away? They didn’t stand, because the LORD pushed them.",
      "ko": "너희 장사들이 쓰러짐은 어찜이뇨 그들의 서지 못함은 여호와께서 그들을 몰아내신 연고니라",
      "source_text_hash": "f525d45549760a20436e7bf1ee0612341412edbf63a5091aa23b31066a9b96c6",
      "translation_text_hash": "1e4a5d4783f1eabcc3f937a5ead85a123dd6d71ac714a67a1afd332c2dc27a6d",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
