      "en": "They cried there, ‘Pharaoh king of Egypt is but a noise; he has let the appointed time pass by.’",
      "ko": "거기서 부르짖기를 애굽 왕 바로가 망하였도다 그가 시기를 잃었도다",
      "source_text_hash": "8967f46317506e54c2e57bd0b6a0ec3be2f674a81752cfc799f7a3656c6b58c2",
      "translation_text_hash": "4f3aab8a7a45f202f57ba55944156a2c5b833857a17b2d0a5120f362111e6197",
