      "en": "You daughter who dwells in Egypt, furnish yourself to go into captivity; for Memphis will become a desolation, and will be burned up, without inhabitant.",
      "ko": "애굽에 사는 딸이여 너는 너를 위하여 포로의 행리를 준비하라 놉이 황무하며 불에 타서 거민이 없을 것임이니라",
      "source_text_hash": "a430cc1a84464548bb6c19be72ee5a4907e0d9d379e88e0c7be99c9fb4600e99",
      "translation_text_hash": "ffaf06a154a307696a2305b9828baf6802cb7f2ab4cd46c8480bcbb7a5cca0f7",
