      "en": "“Egypt is a very beautiful heifer; but destruction out of the north has come. It has come.",
      "ko": "애굽은 심히 아름다운 암송아지라도 북에서부터 멸망이 이르렀고 이르렀느니라",
      "source_text_hash": "79d9fcdff0004e9b68e55cc97a076956cfece238c4c80e60abed380fd08d565c",
